  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A tinted, liquid lip balm that cushions lips with weightless nourishment to hydrate and protect for shine without stickiness.  <strong><br><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Balm & Treatment, Lip Gloss</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Organic Jojoba, Almond, and Argan Oil Blend: Hydrates and softens.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Nourishes and soothes.</p><p>- Plant-Based Seed Oil: Imparts a cushion sensation without stickiness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This hydrating gloss-meets-balm combines naturally</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply from the center of the bottom lip outward. <br>-Can also be layered over Lip Suede (sold separately) in a similar tone.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">- Jojoba, Almond, and Argan Oil Blend: Hydrates, softens. <br>- Shea Butter: Nourishes, soothes.<br>Plant Based Seed Oil: Pillowy finish without stickiness.<br><br>DIISOSTEAROYL POLYGLYCERYL-3 DIMER DILINOLEATE, RICINUS COMMUNIS (CASTOR) SEED OIL, OCTYLDODECANOL, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, MICA, FRAGRANCE/PARFUM, TOCOPHEROL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LIMONENE, CITRAL, LINALOOL, CITRONELLOL, MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR (+/-): TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), CARMINE (CI 75470), MANGANESE VIOLET (CI 77742), RED 6 (CI 15850).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A tinted, liquid lip balm that cushions lips with weightless nourishment to hydrate and protect for shine without stickiness.  <strong><br><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Balm & Treatment, Lip Gloss</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Organic Jojoba, Almond, and Argan Oil Blend: Hydrates and softens.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Nourishes and soothes.</p><p>- Plant-Based Seed Oil: Imparts a cushion sensation without stickiness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This hydrating gloss-meets-balm combines naturally</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply from the center of the bottom lip outward. <br>-Can also be layered over Lip Suede (sold separately) in a similar tone.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">- Jojoba, Almond, and Argan Oil Blend: Hydrates, softens. <br>- Shea Butter: Nourishes, soothes.<br>Plant Based Seed Oil: Pillowy finish without stickiness.<br><br>DIISOSTEAROYL POLYGLYCERYL-3 DIMER DILINOLEATE, RICINUS COMMUNIS (CASTOR) SEED OIL, OCTYLDODECANOL, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, MICA, FRAGRANCE/PARFUM, TOCOPHEROL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LIMONENE, CITRAL, LINALOOL, CITRONELLOL, MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR (+/-): TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), CARMINE (CI 75470), MANGANESE VIOLET (CI 77742), RED 6 (CI 15850).</div></details>",
